# trace-view launcher mirrors the trace + shape sidecar here so the
# browser can fetch them. Legacy `.current-trace.*` names + natural-
# URL `<stem>.jsonl` / `<stem>.shape.json` mirrors are both written.
# Any top-level `*.jsonl` / `*.shape.json` in this dir is a mirror;
# tracked fixtures live under subdirectories (`compare/`).
.current-trace.jsonl
.current-trace.shape.json
*.jsonl
*.shape.json
!compare/cards.trace.jsonl
!compare/cards.shape.json
